<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">21052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>The United Nations mission in Afghanistan has logged seven hundred and fifty Afghan casualties from Pakistani airstrikes in the first quarter of this year alone.</s> <s>Pakistan's military carried out ninety-four of ninety-five recorded incidents, including a Ramadan strike on a hospital that killed two hundred and sixty-nine people.</s> <s>Islamabad raised human rights at the same Security Council session where the dead Afghans went unnamed.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Xi Jinping is preparing his first visit to Pyongyang since two thousand and nineteen, with no date yet confirmed.</s> <s>Kim Jong Un travelled to Beijing alongside Vladimir Putin last year, and Seoul's intelligence service now believes Beijing may seek to mediate between North Korea and Washington.</s> <s>The sequencing matters more than the trip itself... Xi is positioning himself as the convening power while Washington remains preoccupied with Iran.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One hundred and ten of one hundred and twenty Knesset members voted to advance a bill dissolving Israel's parliament, with not a single member opposed.</s> <s>The collapse follows a standoff over conscription of Haredi men, an exemption that's divided Israeli society since the state's founding in nineteen forty-eight.</s> <s>Early elections would put Benjamin Netanyahu's corruption trial and the Gaza policy on the ballot simultaneously, in sha'Allah forcing a reckoning the coalition has spent two years deferring.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Britain has publicly disclosed that a Russian Su-twenty-seven fighter flew six metres from a Royal Air Force spy plane over the Black Sea in April.</s> <s>NATO has flown Black Sea surveillance since two thousand and fourteen without ever publishing an incident report, so the disclosure itself is the escalation.</s> <s>The Ministry of Defence called it the most dangerous Russian air action in years, and a near miss at that altitude can trigger alliance obligations even without a shot fired.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Delhi's sixty-eight transport unions have frozen the capital's roads through Saturday, with drivers saying app payouts have halved as crude oil hit one hundred and twenty dollars a barrel.</s> <s>Auto and cab fares are locked to a scheme written in two thousand and eleven, long before any energy shock of this scale.</s> <s>A war four thousand kilometres away has surfaced inside Indian household budgets as a transport shutdown, and the unions warn the three-day stop becomes indefinite without fare revision.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>United States Marines have boarded an Iranian-flagged tanker in the Gulf of Oman, the first physical boarding under Washington's naval blockade of Iranian ports imposed last month.</s> <s>Central Command has now stopped ninety-one vessels, redirecting commercial ships before releasing them, while Iran's envoy at the United Nations called the boardings piracy.</s> <s>A unilateral blockade backed by armed boardings is an act of war under customary international law, even before missiles fly.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Indonesia's President Prabowo Subianto has centralised palm oil and thermal coal exports through a single state-owned firm.</s> <s>Indonesia leads the world in thermal coal exports and supplies roughly fifty-five percent of global palm oil, so this is a bid for cartel-style pricing power on two commodities at once.</s> <s>Foreign investors are pushing back as the rupiah falls to historic lows, but Jakarta appears willing to spend currency stability to buy leverage.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>On Barbuda's Pink Sands beach, Miranda Beazer has refused every developer offer for a plot her family held communally before Hurricane Irma.</s> <s>Post-storm rebuilding in Antigua and Barbuda has drawn only resort-scale capital, so developers now hold land that belonged to villages before the storm cleared the island.</s> <s>This is climate adaptation as dispossession, and the property regime that's emerging will outlast every developer who set it in motion.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ebola has crossed from the Democratic Republic of Congo into Uganda, with Kinshasa now reporting six hundred suspected cases and one hundred and thirty-nine suspected deaths.</s> <s>Only fifty-one of those deaths have been laboratory confirmed, and the World Health Organization warns the outbreak is in its exponential phase.</s> <s>Britain has pledged nearly twenty-seven million dollars, the largest single donor commitment so far, though that figure will likely be obsolete within weeks if containment fails.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Papua New Guinea, Fiji, and Vanuatu have created five joint enforcement zones across the Melanesian Pacific, banning all fishing rather than only industrial trawlers.</s> <s>Vanuatu's prime minister framed the move as solidarity over colonial rule, a deliberate echo of the decolonisation language Pacific island states have used for fifty years.</s> <s>No great power has ratified the zones, which means enforcement will fall on the same small navies that drew the lines.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A research team in London has unveiled a brain-scan system that scores its own explanations on two quantitative measures, shape and faithfulness.</s> <s>Expert radiologists confirmed nearly eighty-eight percent of those explanations as correct across more than seven thousand images, addressing the standard clinical complaint that deep learning outputs heatmaps without telling clinicians how trustworthy each one actually is.</s> <s>Medical artificial intelligence is quietly shifting from beating radiologists to giving them auditable evidence.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Mathematicians Peter Scholze and Dustin Clausen have published proofs scrapping the open-set foundation that's underpinned topology for one hundred and seventy years.</s> <s>Their condensed mathematics reconciles structures that break where algebra meets analysis, replacing the discipline's core primitive.</s> <s>Whether the broader field adopts the rewrite remains open, but the proofs are now public and the conversation has begun in Bonn.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Donald Trump has signed an executive order giving the United States government ninety days of pre-release access to new artificial intelligence models.</s> <s>The requirement mirrors what OpenAI and Anthropic have already offered without compulsion, and the framework is voluntary rather than binding.</s> <s>Make America Great Again activists had demanded mandatory security vetting, so the gap between the security concerns being raised and the non-binding mechanism being proposed tells you who the regulation is written for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One hundred and thirty million Europeans will gain a new account-to-account payment rail as five bank-owned national systems merge into a single hub.</s> <s>The new infrastructure routes transactions without passing through American card networks, a deliberate move toward payments sovereignty after years of European complaints about extraterritorial fees and data.</s> <s>Person-to-person transfers launch across thirteen countries this year, with in-store and online payments to follow.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Chromium browser flaw that's gone unpatched for twenty-nine months now has a public exploit.</s> <s>Any website can silently recruit a Chromium browser into a botnet through its background-fetch interface, and the malicious service worker survives a reboot.</s> <s>Firefox and Safari are unaffected, but Chrome, Edge, Brave, and Opera have no patch and no timeline, leaving billions of users exposed while the disclosure clock ticks.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>